<title>USA: AMB Financial to buy back five pct of shrs.</title>
<headline>AMB Financial to buy back five pct of shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MUNSTER, Ind. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMB Financial Corp said Friday it notified the Office of Thrift Supervision that it plans to repurchase five percent of its outstanding common shares in the open market over the next 12 months.</p>
<p>An AMB Financial spokesman said the buyback program will involve approximately 50,726 common shares.</p>
<p>AMB Fincancial is the parent of American Savings FSB.</p>
<p>Its shares were up 3/8 Friday at 14-5/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
